From 5e59f17f8adb7699feee17a35da683f3492fba3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:06:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 237/270] tegra_dc: brightness and display power

The brightness of the Screen preferences sets the duty cycle of the PWM
driving the panel backlight (1 to 256), and the DPMS modes switch the
backlight off and back on as it was. Both only when the firmware left the
PWM running; the brightness keys of the embedded controller keep working
alongside.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
